# Build/test scratch. `.smoke.build.luau` is the composed load-test chunk
# bundle.py writes — it's deleted when the test passes and DELIBERATELY left
# behind when it fails, so you can run `luau tests/.smoke.build.luau` yourself
# and read the traceback with real line numbers.
tests/.smoke.build.luau

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
